+// Key map (Nintendo layout): WASD left stick, arrow keys D-pad (with Shift held: the right stick, for the camera), J=A K=B U=X I=Y, Q=L E=R, Z=ZL C=ZR, F=press left stick G=press right stick, Return=+ Tab=−, Space=shake the controller; the sidebar's Controls section remaps it and the controllers' buttons per game (controls_load). NXForge: with DM_MOUSE_CAMERA=1 the right mouse button held is a mouse camera (the right stick; mcam_hold).
 // Controllers: face buttons as on the iPhone, by position (right A, bottom B, top X, left Y) or on a Nintendo pad by its labels (pad_apple.h) while the face buttons are not remapped, shoulders L R, triggers ZL ZR, Menu + Options −, both sticks and their presses.
